{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgwvVGHhxjJm5RimUQv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Credit Decision: CR-9207\n\n**Request.** CR-9207 (ERP: 2026-09-23) is Sarah Chen's request to raise Acme Industrial Supply Co.'s (C-1044) credit limit from $50,000 to $500,000. The justification cites \"the Acme parent guarantee.\"\n\n**The customer.** C-1044, Acme Industrial Supply Co. (DUNS 09-552-1187, Akron, OH); CRM account CRM-2091, tier **Standard**.\n\n**Policy.** CREDIT-POLICY-2026 applies (effective 2026-01-01 through 2026-12-31). The request date falls within this period.\n\n**Payment history.** Looking back 12 months from 2026-09-23, C-1044 has two invoices:\n- INV-30001: due 2025-02-25, paid 2025-03-04 (7 days late)\n- INV-30003: due 2025-05-07, paid 2025-04-28 (early)\n\nPolicy rule: \"no invoice due in the 12 months before the request may have been paid more than 30 days after its due date, or be unpaid more than 30 days after it.\" **C-1044 is compliant.** ✓\n\n**Maximum limit.** CREDIT-POLICY-2026, Section 5: Standard accounts have a maximum of **$250,000**. A parent-company guarantee \"raises the maximum by the guaranteed amount, **for the customer the guarantee names.**\"\n\nThe guarantee cited is GRT-ACME-2026, which guarantees \"**Acme Mfg. Holdings** ... No other company is covered.\" Acme Mfg. Holdings is C-1001 (Strategic account), not C-1044.\n\nAcme Support Schedule C (SUP-ACME-C) is explicit: \"Coverage does not extend to... **Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered.**\"\n\n**The guarantee does not apply to C-1044.** C-1044's maximum limit is $250,000. The requested limit of $500,000 **exceeds** the maximum.\n\n**Authority.** The requested limit ($500,000) would require Finance Manager approval under CREDIT-POLICY-2026. Sarah Chen, as Enterprise Account Executive and requestor, is not authorized under the policy (separation of duties applies).\n\n**Eligibility and decision.** C-1044 is **ineligible** because the requested limit exceeds the maximum limit for a Standard account. The guarantee relied upon does not cover this customer.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9207\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. (C-1044)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 50000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 500000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 250000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account maximum $250,000 under Credit Policy 2026; parent guarantee cited does not cover this customer\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Credit Policy 2026: Maximum $250,000 for Standard accounts\",\n    \"CRM-2091 (Acme Industrial Supply Co., C-1044): Account tier Standard\",\n    \"Parent Company Guarantee GRT-ACME-2026: Guarantor is Acme Group Holdings, Inc.; guaranteed party is Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001); explicit: 'No other company is covered'\",\n    \"Acme Support Schedule C (SUP-ACME-C): 'Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered'\",\n    \"C-1044 payment history (12 months prior): INV-30001 paid 7 days late (compliant); INV-30003 paid early. Meets policy payment rule.\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"The request cites 'the Acme parent guarantee' as the basis. Guarantee GRT-ACME-2026 covers Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001) only. Acme Industrial Supply Co. (C-1044) is explicitly excluded. The two companies are separate entities. This guarantee does not provide credit support for C-1044.\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25235,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25235},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca298a6d-0988-4e94-b112-0fb25d6a6b2f","uuid":"8255163e-629a-423d-be36-da6811b05f5a","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:28:11.164Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgwvFsG12zNqCKRXq8S"}
